OL,14,G2032 Discovery
OL,15,     FAeons before antibiotics stocked
OL,16,     Fpharmacy shelves, bacteria were
OL,17,     Fkilled by viruses called
OL,18,     Fbacteriophages. Could these
OL,19,     Fnew/old weapons take up the global
OL,20,     Fbattle with superbugs?
