OL,8,G0232 Assignment
OL,9,     FIn Germany the system makes it
OL,10,     Fhard for disabled people to find
OL,11,     Fwork. Often they find jobs in
OL,12,     Finstitutions that pay less than
OL,13,     Fminimum wage. So how could Germany
OL,14,     Fbe more inclusive?
